Route35_Text_PicnickerKimIntro::
	.string "Are you going to the GYM? Me too!$"

Route35_Text_PicnickerKimDefeat::
	.string "Oh. I couldn’t win...$"

Route35_Text_PicnickerKim::
	.string "The GYM BADGES are pretty. I collect\n"
	.string "them.$"

Route35_Text_CamperElliotIntro::
	.string "I’m gonna show my girlfriend I’m hot\n"
	.string "stuff!$"

Route35_Text_CamperElliotDefeat::
	.string "I wish you would have lost for me...$"

Route35_Text_CamperElliot::
	.string "I was humiliated in front of my\n"
	.string "girlfriend...$"

Route35_Text_PicnickerBrookeIntro::
	.string "My boyfriend’s weak, so I can’t\n"
	.string "rely on him.$"

Route35_Text_PicnickerBrookeDefeat::
	.string "Oh, my! You’re so strong!$"

Route35_Text_PicnickerBrooke::
	.string "I can count on my POKéMON more than\n"
	.string "my boyfriend.$"

Route35_Text_CamperIvanIntro::
	.string "I’ve been getting POKéMON data off\n"
	.string "my radio. I think I’m good.$"

Route35_Text_CamperIvanDefeat::
	.string "I give!$"

Route35_Text_CamperIvan::
	.string "Music on the radio changes the moods\n"
	.string "of wild POKéMON.$"

Route35_Text_FirebreatherWaltIntro::
	.string "I’m practicing my fire breathing.$"

Route35_Text_FirebreatherWaltDefeat::
	.string "Ow! I scorched the tip of my nose!$"

Route35_Text_FirebreatherWalt::
	.string "The POKéMON March on the radio lures\n"
	.string "wild POKéMON.$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228Intro::
	.string "Behold my graceful BALL dexterity!$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228Defeat::
	.string "Whew! That was a jolt!$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_1::
	.string "I was going to dazzle you with my\n"
	.string "prize POKéMON.\p"
	.string "But your prowess electrified me!$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_2::
	.string "I was waiting for you.\n"
	.string "Let’s battle!$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228Victory::
	.string "$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_3::
	.string "Your PHONE CARD doesn’t have enough\n"
	.string "memory for more numbers.$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_4::
	.string "Wow, you’re good at battling.\p"
	.string "Want to add me on your PHONE CARD?\p"
	.string "You can call me for another battle.$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_5::
	.string "Oh, fine then...\p"
	.string "If you want to get my phone number,\n"
	.string "just tell me.$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_6::
	.string "Register my phone number?$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_7::
	.string "The phone number was registered on\n"
	.string "the PHONE CARD.$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_8::
	.string "Call me if something’s up.$"

Route35_Text_Juggler228_9::
	.string "Delete my phone number?$"

Route35_Text_OfficerDirkIntro::
	.string "Danger lurks in the night!$"

Route35_Text_OfficerDirkDefeat::
	.string "Whoops!$"

Route35_Text_OfficerDirk::
	.string "You know, nighttime is fun in its\n"
	.string "own ways.\p"
	.string "But don’t overdo it, OK?$"

Route35_Text_BugCatcher95Intro::
	.string "I’ll go anywhere if bug POKéMON\n"
	.string "appear there.$"

Route35_Text_BugCatcher95Defeat::
	.string "I see. So you battle that way.$"

Route35_Text_BugCatcher95::
	.string "My VENONAT won me the Bug-Catching\n"
	.string "Contest at the NATIONAL PARK.$"

Route35_Text_BirdKeeperBryanIntro::
	.string "What kinds of POKéBALLS do you use?$"

Route35_Text_BirdKeeperBryanDefeat::
	.string "Yikes! Not fast enough!$"

Route35_Text_BirdKeeperBryan::
	.string "If you want to catch low level\n"
	.string "POKéMON, I’d recommend you\l"
	.string "KURT’s NEST BALL.\p"
	.string "Whenever I find a WHT APRICORN, I\n"
	.string "take it to KURT.\p"
	.string "He turns it into a custom POKéBALL.$"

