	.string "ROUTE 35$"

Route35_Text_Sign3::
	.string "It’s a fruit-bearing tree.\p"
	.string "Hey! It’s LEPPA BERRY!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_1::
	.string "Who do you want to call?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_2::
	.string "Hello? Oh, hi, {PLAYER}!\n"
	.string "Working hard?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_3::
	.string "Hello, {PLAYER}?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_4::
	.string "Try not to overdo it.\p"
	.string "Be sure to heal your POKéMON if\n"
	.string "they are hurt.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_5::
	.string "...\n"
	.string "...$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_6::
	.string "You’re visiting CHERRYGROVE CITY?\p"
	.string "How about coming home for a bit?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_7::
	.string "{PLAYER}, keep it up!\n"
	.string "I’m rooting for you, baby!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_8::
	.string "Oh, so you’re in VIOLET CITY...\p"
	.string "Isn’t that where SPROUT TOWER is?\n"
	.string "Did you go take a look?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_9::
	.string "Oh, so you’re in AZALEA TOWN...\p"
	.string "Isn’t that where SLOWPOKE WELL is?\n"
	.string "Did you go take a look?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_10::
	.string "Oh, so you’re in GOLDENROD CITY...\p"
	.string "Isn’t that where RADIO TOWER is?\n"
	.string "Did you go take a look?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_11::
	.string "Really, you’re in ECRUTEAK CITY?\p"
	.string "I’ve never gone there.\n"
	.string "That’s kind of neat, {PLAYER}.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_12::
	.string "Oh, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "You’re on a big mission for PROF.\n"
	.string "ELM? Be good!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_13::
	.string "I heard from PROF. ELM that you went\n"
	.string "on a long trip.\p"
	.string "I wish you would have told me...\p"
	.string "I have a gift for your journey.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_14::
	.string "I am waiting to see that mysterious\n"
	.string "POKéBALL.\p"
	.string "Please, hurry up, {PLAYER}!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_15::
	.string "How is the EGG?\p"
	.string "What?\n"
	.string "It hatched?\p"
	.string "Wow! What kind of POKéMON is\n"
	.string "it?\p"
	.string "Please come show me now!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_16::
	.string "How’s the EGG? Has anything changed?\p"
	.string "If anything happens, please call.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_17::
	.string "Did you see my assistant? He’s at\n"
	.string "the POKéMON CENTER in VIOLET CITY.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_18::
	.string "We’re checking the EGG now. It does\n"
	.string "appear to be a POKéMON EGG.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_19::
	.string "I’m very upset now.\p"
	.string "We had a POKéMON stolen from here.\n"
	.string "How could anyone do that?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_20::
	.string "Click!\p"
	.string "...$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_21::
	.string "Empty Memory Slot.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_22::
	.string "That sounds really tough.\p"
	.string "But, {PLAYER}, I know you’re really\n"
	.string "determined.\l"
	.string "You’ll be OK, right?$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_23::
	.string "...Wow, I’ve never gone there.\p"
	.string "That’s kind of neat, {PLAYER}.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_24::
	.string "...Really?\n"
	.string "You always sound so excited.\p"
	.string "Good luck on your POKéMON quest!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_25::
	.string "...Wow, that sounded like a tough\n"
	.string "battle.\p"
	.string "Keep working hard, sweetie!$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_26::
	.string "I just made a new discovery.\p"
	.string "The time it takes for an EGG to\n"
	.string "hatch depends on the POKéMON.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_27::
	.string "It’s still a mystery what kinds\n"
	.string "of moves hatched POKéMON have.\p"
	.string "We’re investigating that now.$"

Route35_Text_Sign4_28::
	.string "You sound quite excited...\p"
	.string "Wow... You already have some BADGES\n"
	.string "from the KANTO REGION?\p"
	.string "Congratulations, {PLAYER}!\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "...What?\p"
	.string "You found a strange POKéBALL?\p"
	.string "Hmmm... That sounds like a mystery\n"
	.string "to be solved...\p"
	.string "...\p"
	.string "This may be hard for you, but\n"
	.string "could you come back to the lab?\p"
	.string "I’ve heard the SS.AQUA II has\n"
	.string "arrived at VERMILION CITY.\p"
	.string "Please, I need to see that strange\n"
	.string "POKéBALL!\p"
	.string "I’ll be waiting!$"

